* IRL2FA behavioural models. Fitted to datasheet headline figures only; they
* are good enough for the margins checked in the benches, not for detailed
* analysis. SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0

* MBR0530 Schottky (30 V, 0.5 A, Vf ~0.38 V @ 100 mA)
.model MBR0530 D(Is=2.6u Rs=0.15 N=1.0 Cjo=170p M=0.5 Bv=30 Ibv=20u)
* NX3008NBK N-FET, booster switch (Nexperia data sheet 5 Nov 2022, Table 7: Vgs(th)
* 0.6-1.1 V, Rds(on) 2.1 ohm max @ 2.5 V / 200 mA); worst case: Vth 1.1, KP from 2.1 ohm
.model NX3008 NMOS(Level=1 VTO=1.1 KP=0.34)
* AO3401A P-FET (Vth -0.9 V, Rds(on) 85 mohm @ -2.5 V)
.model AO3401 PMOS(Level=1 VTO=-0.9 KP=7.4)
* AO3400A N-FET (Vth 1.05 V, Rds(on) 48 mohm @ 2.5 V)
.model AO3400 NMOS(Level=1 VTO=1.05 KP=14.4)
* Body diodes
.model DBODY D(Is=1e-12 N=1.2 Rs=0.05)
* VSMB2948SL IR emitter (Vf ~1.25 V @ 20 mA)
.model IRLED D(Is=2e-16 N=1.5 Rs=1.0)

* P-FET with body diode: drain gate source
.subckt PFET d g s
M1 d g s s AO3401
Db d s DBODY
.ends
* N-FET with body diode: drain gate source
.subckt NFET_SW d g s
M1 d g s s NX3008
Db s d DBODY
.ends
.subckt NFET_LED d g s
M1 d g s s AO3400
Db s d DBODY
.ends

* CR2450 coin cell: open-circuit voltage and internal resistance as params
.subckt CELL p n params: voc=3.0 rint=15
V1 x n {voc}
R1 x p {rint}
.ends
